<title>UK: KFW unit sets $500 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets $500 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON		   MATURITY    06.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE		PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER		  SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US,UK,DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	  HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125 BP  SELL CONC  0.2</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT 2007 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	TO BE PRICED. GUARANTEED BY KREDITANSTALT FUER</p>
<p>		WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
